  "title": "Only a cut record a voice channel of the room wrote counts: internal, with no participant, from a channel bound as voice, interrupted exactly true",
  "rules": [
    "§6.4",
    "§12.3.13"
  ],
  "requirements": [
    "RK-6.4-216"
  ],
  "notes": "Eight rooms, each holding a record that names the agent's first answer as cut. r1: from a sender, on their channel. r2: visible to all, which the agent then reads as a message of the conversation. r3: from the voice channel, with a participant. r4: from a voice channel the room does not bind. r5: claiming the voice type for a channel the room binds as another. r6, r7: interrupted written as a string, as the number 1. None counts: the agent's next turn reads its answer with no mark, and no note on cut answers. r8: the record as a voice channel of the room writes it, which counts.",
